satisfies the \"read the content\" requirement. I could optionally note that the full PDF exists but I didn't extract it (due to coverage constraints).\n\nAlright, let me now produce the final answer:\n\nReport details:\n- Official name: \"2026 Q2 China Monetary Policy Implementation Report\" (2026 Q2 China Monetary Policy Implementation Report)\n- Period: 2026 Q2 (the 2nd quarterly report of 2026)\n- Official publication date: 2026-08-12 (page timestamp 2026-08-12 18:26:05)\n- Official URL: https://www.pbc.gov.cn/zhengcehuobisi/125207/125227/125957/2026nhbzczxbg/2026081218435062865/index.html\n- PDF: https://www.pbc.gov.cn/zhengcehuobisi/125207/125227/125957/2026nhbzczxbg/2026081218435062865/2026081218435024793.pdf\n\nThree key points (all from the official content summary on the page — citing the original):\n\n1. Policy stance: continue implementing a moderately accommodative monetary policy, leverage the integrated effects of existing and incremental policies; for the next phase, \"fully leverage the effectiveness of each existing policy, promptly formulate and introduce practical and effective incremental policies, strengthen counter-cyclical adjustment, and boost domestic demand expansion and supply optimization.\" Comprehensive use and timely adjustment of monetary policy tools, maintaining ample liquidity.\n\n2. Aggregate and structural tools: comprehensively employ reverse repos, MLF, government bond buying/selling operations, etc.; improve the short-end interest rate adjustment mechanism (adding an overnight reverse repo operation instrument, narrowing the width of the temporary positive/negative repo operation corridor from 70bp to 50bp); lower the interest rates on structural monetary policy tools by 0.25 percentage points; separately establish a 1 trillion yuan re-lending facility for private enterprises, consolidate agricultural and small-business re-lending with rediscount quotas, and increase the quota for technology innovation and technological transformation re-lending.\n\n3. Economic and price situation/achievements and exchange rate: H1 GDP up 4.7% YoY; as of end-June, the stock of aggregate social financing and M2 up 7.4% and 8.0% YoY respectively; DR001 averaged 1.31% over the first six months; newly issued corporate loan rate in June around 3.0% (down about 20bp YoY), personal mortgage rate around 3.1%; at end-June the RMB/USD closing rate at 6.7852, up 3% from end of previous year, CFETS index at 102.59 up 4.7%. External environment: the global inflation level has risen, and the monetary policies of major economies' central banks are trending toward adjustment. Next phase: maintain basic stability of the RMB exchange rate at a reasonable equilibrium level, and guard against the risk of exchange rate overshooting.\n\nI need to distinguish between direct quotes from the original text and my own summaries. Since the page only has the content summary (not the full report body), the three key points are essentially a compression of the official summary — I'll note that the full report (chapters, special boxes, data tables) is inside the PDF but I did not extract it.\n\nNote: the HTML page only has the content summary, and the full body text is inside the PDF. I'll explicitly note this in the coverage note.\n\nProcess note: direct access to http://www.pbc.gov.cn timed out, and http on the listing page returned 403, but https worked fine. Mention this briefly.\n\nAlright, let me now write the final self-contained answer.\n\n已成功从中国人民银行官网读取最新一期报告。以下为完整结果：\n\n# 报告基本信息（均来自官网）\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|---|---|\n| 报告全称 | 《2026年第二季度中国货币政策执行报告》 |\n| 期次 | 2026年第二季度（2026年第2期季报） |\n| 官方发布日期 | **2026-08-12**（页面时间戳 2026-08-12 18:26:05） |\n| 官方原文 URL | https://www.pbc.gov.cn/zhengcehuobisi/125207/125227/125957/2026nhbzczxbg/2026081218435062865/index.html |\n| PDF 全文附件 | https://www.pbc.gov.cn/zhengcehuobisi/125207/125227/125957/2026nhbzczxbg/2026081218435062865/2026081218435024793.pdf |\n\n官网栏目页（货币政策司 → 货币政策执行报告）确认这是当前最新一期，上一期为 2026年第一季度报告（2026-05-11 发布）。\n\n# 三个要点摘要\n\n**要点一｜政策基调：继续实施适度宽松的货币政策，下阶段\"加大逆周期调节、谋划增量政策\"**\n报告明确\"继续实施适度宽松的货币政策，发挥存量政策与增量政策集成效应\"；下阶段要\"充分发挥各项存量政策效能，及时谋划出台务实管用的增量政策，加大逆周期调节力度，加力扩大内需、优化供给\"，并\"综合运用并适时调整货币政策工具，保持流动性充裕和社会融资条件相对宽松\"。（直接引自官网页面\"内容摘要\"原文）\n\n**要点二｜总量与结构工具：短端利率调控机制完善 + 结构性工具降息、扩容**\n总量端：综合运用逆回购、MLF、国债买卖操作保持流动性充裕；在公开市场操作中增加隔夜逆回购操作品种，将临时正、逆回购操作区间宽度由 70 个基点收窄至 50 个基点，并创设境外央行回购工具。结构端：下调结构性货币政策工具利率 0.25 个百分点；单设 1 万亿元民营企业再贷款，合并使用支农支小再贷款与再贴现额度，增加科技创新和技术改造再贷款额度，合并设立科技创新与民营企业债券风险分担工具。（直接来自原文）\n\n**要点三｜经济形势与关键数据：上半年 GDP 增长 4.7%，融资成本低位运行，汇率基本稳定**\n原文披露：上半年 GDP 同比增长 4.7%；6 月末社融存量、M2 同比分别增长 7.4% 和 8.0%；DR001 前 6 个月均值 1.31%；6 月新发放企业贷款利率约 3.0%（同比低约 20 个基点），个人住房贷款利率约 3.1%；6 月末人民币对美元收盘价 6.7852 元，较上年末升值 3%，CFETS 人民币汇率指数 102.59、升值 4.7%。对外部环境，报告提示\"世界经济增长动能疲弱……全球通胀水平有所抬升，主要经济体央行货币政策趋向调整\"，下阶段要\"防范汇率超调风险，保持人民币汇率在合理均衡水平上的基本稳定\"。（数据与表述均来自原文）\n\n# 来源与概括说明\n\n- 以上三个要点的全部事实、数字和引语**均直接来自官网页面的\"内容摘要\"**（央行随报告发布的官方摘要），仅做了归纳压缩和分组，未添加任何外部信息。\n- **覆盖范围**：官网 HTML 正文页只刊载\"内容摘要\"，报告全文（各章节正文、专栏、详细数据表）在 PDF 附件中，本次**未下载提取 PDF**；如需专栏内容（如短端利率调控机制专栏等）可再提取该 PDF。\n- **访问过程**：http:// 直连官网首页超时、列表页曾返回 403（反爬），改用 https:// 后栏目页与详情页均读取成功；全部结论基于官方来源，未使用非官方来源。\n\n<task_metadata>\nsession_id: ses_fb7ef3de3ffe4oCp3qoRH1u8DM\ntask_id: ses_fb7ef3de3ffe4oCp3qoRH1u8DM\nsubagent: web-docs-agent\n</task_metadata>\n\nto continue: task(task_id=\"ses_fb7ef3de3ffe4oCp3qoRH1u8DM\", load_skills=[], run_in_background=false, prompt=\"...\")","metadata":{"truncated":false,"prompt":"任务：找到中国人民银行（PBOC）最新一期《货币政策执行报告》的官方原文页面，读取内容，并总结三个要点。\n\n具体要求：\n1. 目标站点优先使用中国人民银行官网 www.pbc.gov.cn（货币政策司 → 货币政策执行报告栏目，通常在 http://www.pbc.gov.cn/zhengcehuobisi/125207/125227/125957/ 之类路径下，或通过官网搜索\"货币政策执行报告\"）。如官网直连失败，用免 key 搜索（DuckDuckGo 等）找到官方原文页面 URL，再读取。\n2. 确认是哪一期（例如 2025 年第几季度《中国货币政策执行报告》，发布日期）。今天是 2026-08-28，最新一期理论上应是 2026 年第二季度报告（2026 年 8 月中旬发布）或更早的一期——以官网实际发布的最新一期为准，并在结果中明确报告名称和发布日期。\n3. 报告正文通常是 HTML 页面 + PDF 附件。优先读 HTML 正文页；若只有 PDF，用文档读取工具提取文字。\n4. 输出：\n   - 报告全称、期次、官方发布日期、官方原文 URL\n   - 三个要点摘要（每点 1-2 句，基于原文内容，例如货币政策基调、总量与结构工具安排、对经济形势/通胀/汇率的